{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/rsl28a","slide":1,"text":"RouteMind is a proposed web-based delivery planning system for small businesses. It plans routes for multiple orders and vehicles while considering load capacity, order priority and delivery time windows. This presentation covers the problem, context DFD, Level 1 decomposition, Level 2 route optimization, algorithm approach and system architecture."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/589n2p","slide":2,"title":"The delivery planning problem","textShapes":21}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ytknuh43","slide":2,"text":"The delivery planning problem","textPreview":"The delivery planning problem","textChars":29,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,45,1470,64]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lgb6pc3e","slide":2,"text":"A short route alone may still miss a delivery window or exceed a vehicle’s capacity.","textPreview":"A short route alone may still miss a delivery window or exceed a vehicle’s capacity.","textChars":84,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,116,1450,42]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kv25w7mt","slide":2,"text":"RouteMind","textPreview":"RouteMind","textChars":9,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,849,400,22]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bq94j25c","slide":2,"text":"02","textPreview":"02","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1465,845,70,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ap0nqx4r","slide":2,"text":"What businesses need to manage","textPreview":"What businesses need to manage","textChars":30,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,213,690,48]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xsr6lcni","slide":2,"text":"Multiple deliveries","textPreview":"Multiple deliveries","textChars":19,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,298,650,37]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cri5s7mx","slide":2,"text":"A useful stop sequence for each driver.","textPreview":"A useful stop sequence for each driver.","textChars":39,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,340,670,41]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/nm94f25g","slide":2,"text":"Vehicle capacity","textPreview":"Vehicle capacity","textChars":16,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,407,650,37]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2lgnmx4v","slide":2,"text":"Loads must fit the assigned vehicle.","textPreview":"Loads must fit the assigned vehicle.","textChars":36,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,449,670,41]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/onq5kfu5","slide":2,"text":"Priority and time windows","textPreview":"Priority and time windows","textChars":25,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,516,650,37]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/poz6tkvq","slide":2,"text":"Urgent orders and customer availability matter.","textPreview":"Urgent orders and customer availability matter.","textChars":47,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,558,670,41]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2loni5cz","slide":2,"text":"Multiple drivers","textPreview":"Multiple drivers","textChars":16,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,625,650,37]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3mxoradk","slide":2,"text":"Work must match available drivers and vehicles.","textPreview":"Work must match available drivers and vehicles.","textChars":47,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,667,670,41]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gj65gvu9","slide":2,"text":"RouteMind’s proposed solution","textPreview":"RouteMind’s proposed solution","textChars":29,"textLines":1,"bbox":[825,213,690,48]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1kf6p0vu","slide":2,"text":"INPUT","textPreview":"INPUT","textChars":5,"textLines":1,"bbox":[825,300,170,31]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/exone5c3","slide":2,"text":"Orders, locations, vehicles, drivers,\ncapacity, priority and time limits","textPreview":"Orders, locations, vehicles, drivers, | capacity, priority and time limits","textChars":72,"textLines":2,"bbox":[825,341,690,82]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fix4nado","slide":2,"text":"PLANNING","textPreview":"PLANNING","textChars":8,"textLines":1,"bbox":[825,464,200,31]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0fa5szud","slide":2,"text":"Validate inputs and find a feasible\nroute plan with a lower travel cost.","textPreview":"Validate inputs and find a feasible | route plan with a lower travel cost.","textChars":72,"textLines":2,"bbox":[825,505,680,83]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lgj614by","slide":2,"text":"OUTPUT","textPreview":"OUTPUT","textChars":6,"textLines":1,"bbox":[825,630,170,31]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9cf6l432","slide":2,"text":"Driver routes, estimated arrival times,\ndelivery progress and analytics","textPreview":"Driver routes, estimated arrival times, | delivery progress and analytics","textChars":71,"textLines":2,"bbox":[825,671,690,83]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8b65czmh","slide":2,"text":"When an order changes, RouteMind recalculates the remaining deliveries and informs the affected driver.","textPreview":"When an order changes, RouteMind recalculates the remaining deliveries and informs the affected driver.","textChars":103,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,786,1470,46]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/589n2p","slide":2,"text":"This is a proposal, not a claim of measured savings. The system accepts delivery addresses, order load, priority, time windows and service time, plus vehicle capacities and driver availability. It validates the inputs, prepares routes and monitors delivery updates. Capacity and time windows can be treated as hard limits. Priority helps order feasible deliveries. Added, cancelled or delayed orders trigger replanning of unfinished stops while preserving completed deliveries. Infeasible orders are flagged for the business to resolve."}
